---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="護身術・逮捕術"
  description="泰山流護身術・逮捕術 — 60年以上の武道経験に基づく実践的な護身術。合気柔術・柔道・空手の精髄を融合した東京八王子本部道場。"
>

  <!-- ヒーローセクション -->
  <section class="sd-hero">
    <img
      src="https://pub-488a24026ed4411b8d591260b603cdd1.r2.dev/dojo/DOJO_07.webp"
      alt="泰山流道場稽古"
      class="sd-hero-bg"
    />
    <div class="sd-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="sd-hero-content">
      <p class="sd-eyebrow">Taizan-ryu</p>
      <h1 class="sd-hero-title">
        <span class="line-a">護身術</span>
        <span class="line-b">逮捕術</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="sd-hero-sub">守破離の精神で、真の護身を。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sd-hero-scroll">
      <span></span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 説明セクション -->
  <section class="sd-desc">
    <div class="sd-inner">

      <div class="sd-intro reveal">
        <h2>泰山流とは</h2>
        <p>
          泰山流は、宗家ジョー・ミラーが60年以上にわたる武道修行の末に創始した独自の護身術体系です。
          合気柔術・柔道・空手の精髄を融合し、現代社会に生きる人々が身を守るための実践的なシステムとして体系化されました。
          技術の習得だけでなく、日常の危険を察知し回避する「護身意識」を育てることを重視しています。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="sd-pillars">

        <div class="sd-pillar reveal">
          <span class="sd-pillar-num">01</span>
          <div class="sd-pillar-body">
            <h3>合気柔術の技法</h3>
            <p>相手の力を利用し、最小限の力で最大限の効果を引き出す合気柔術の理論を基礎とします。体格差を超えた護身技術を誰でも習得できます。</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sd-pillar reveal">
          <span class="sd-pillar-num">02</span>
          <div class="sd-pillar-body">
            <h3>実践的な逮捕術</h3>
            <p>相手を傷つけず、安全に制圧するための逮捕術。警察官・警備員向けに体系化された技術を、一般の方にも分かりやすく指導します。</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sd-pillar reveal">
          <span class="sd-pillar-num">03</span>
          <div class="sd-pillar-body">
            <h3>現代護身術の統合</h3>
            <p>街中での危険回避、暴漢への対処、護身意識の育成まで。現代の生活環境に即した護身術として、常に進化し続けています。</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 宗家の言葉 -->
  <section class="sd-quote">
    <div class="sd-inner">
      <blockquote class="reveal">
        <p>「本当の護身術とは、戦わずして身を守る知恵と、<br>いざという時に使える技術の両方を持つことだ。」</p>
        <footer>— 宗家 ジョー・ミラー</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 練習動画セクション -->
  <section class="sd-videos">
    <div class="sd-inner">

      <div class="sd-section-header reveal">
        <h2>練習動画</h2>
        <p>道場での稽古の様子をご覧ください。基本技術から実戦応用まで、泰山流の技を動画でお伝えします。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sd-video-grid">

        <div class="sd-video-item reveal">
          <div class="sd-video-wrap">
            <iframe
              src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ"
              title="泰山流護身術 基本技法"
              allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
              allowfullscreen
            ></iframe>
          </div>
          <p class="sd-video-caption">基本技法 — 受け身と基礎動作</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sd-video-item reveal">
          <div class="sd-video-wrap">
            <iframe
              src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ"
              title="泰山流逮捕術"
              allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
              allowfullscreen
            ></iframe>
          </div>
          <p class="sd-video-caption">逮捕術 — 安全な制圧技術</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sd-video-item reveal">
          <div class="sd-video-wrap">
            <iframe
              src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ"
              title="泰山流合気柔術"
              allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
              allowfullscreen
            ></iframe>
          </div>
          <p class="sd-video-caption">合気柔術 — 関節技と投げ技</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sd-video-item reveal">
          <div class="sd-video-wrap">
            <iframe
              src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ"
              title="泰山流組手稽古"
              allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
              allowfullscreen
            ></iframe>
          </div>
          <p class="sd-video-caption">組手稽古 — 実践的な護身訓練</p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="sd-yt-link reveal">
        <a
          href="https://www.youtube.com/@taizanryu"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="sd-btn-outline"
        >YouTube チャンネルで全動画を見る</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- お問い合わせ CTA -->
  <section class="sd-cta">
    <div class="sd-inner reveal">
      <h2>体験稽古のご案内</h2>
      <p>まずは見学・体験稽古から。どなたでもお気軽にお問い合わせください。</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="sd-btn-primary">お問い合わせ</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  /* ===== 共通 ===== */
  .sd-inner {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }

  /* ===== ヒーロー ===== */
  .sd-hero {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100vh;
    min-height: 600px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .sd-hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .sd-hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4) 0%,
      rgba(107, 31, 35, 0.6) 100%
    );
  }

  .sd-hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    text-align: center;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .sd-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: sdFadeUp 0.8s ease 0.2s forwards;
  }

  .sd-hero-title {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .line-a {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 6px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: sdFadeUp 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 0.4s forwards;
  }

  .line-b {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 8px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    opacity: 0;
    animation: sdFadeUp 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 0.6s forwards;
  }

  .sd-hero-sub {
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    opacity: 0;
    animation: sdFadeUp 0.8s ease 0.9s forwards;
  }

  /* スクロールインジケーター */
  .sd-hero-scroll {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 40px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .sd-hero-scroll span {
    display: block;
    width: 1px;
    height: 60px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), transparent);
    margin: 0 auto;
    animation: sdScrollLine 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes sdFadeUp {
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
  }

  @keyframes sdScrollLine {
    0%   { transform: scaleY(0); transform-origin: top; opacity: 1; }
    50%  { transform: scaleY(1); transform-origin: top; opacity: 1; }
    100% { transform: scaleY(1); transform-origin: top; opacity: 0; }
  }

  /* ===== 説明セクション ===== */
  .sd-desc {
    padding: 100px 0;
    background-color: var(--bg-color);
  }

  .sd-intro {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto 80px;
  }

  .sd-intro h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .sd-intro p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 2;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .sd-pillars {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2px;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .sd-pillar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 48px 36px;
    background-color: var(--bg-color);
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .sd-pillar:hover {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  }

  .sd-pillar-num {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .sd-pillar-body h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .sd-pillar-body p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  /* ===== 宗家の言葉 ===== */
  .sd-quote {
    padding: 100px 0;
    background-color: var(--bg-color-secondary);
  }

  .sd-quote blockquote {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .sd-quote blockquote p {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);
    line-height: 2;
    color: #3a2a20;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .sd-quote blockquote footer {
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #7a5a4a;
  }

  /* ===== 動画セクション ===== */
  .sd-videos {
    padding: 100px 0;
    background-color: var(--bg-color);
  }

  .sd-section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .sd-section-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .sd-section-header p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 580px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .sd-video-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }

  .sd-video-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .sd-video-wrap {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-top: 56.25%; /* 16:9 */
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .sd-video-wrap iframe {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: none;
  }

  .sd-video-caption {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    padding-left: 4px;
  }

  .sd-yt-link {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .sd-btn-outline {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 14px 36px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .sd-btn-outline:hover {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  /* ===== CTA ===== */
  .sd-cta {
    padding: 100px 0;
    background-color: #1a120d;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .sd-cta h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .sd-cta p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .sd-btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 16px 48px;
    background-color: #fff;
    color: #1a120d;
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .sd-btn-primary:hover {
    background-color: var(--bg-color-secondary);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  /* ===== レスポンシブ ===== */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .sd-inner {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .sd-desc,
    .sd-quote,
    .sd-videos,
    .sd-cta {
      padding: 60px 0;
    }

    .sd-pillars {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .sd-pillar {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 32px 24px;
    }

    .sd-pillar-num {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      min-width: 40px;
    }

    .sd-video-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .line-a { letter-spacing: 4px; }
    .line-b { letter-spacing: 5px; }
  }
</style>
